<title>USA: EXEL expands stock repurchase program.</title>
<headline>EXEL expands stock repurchase program.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bermuda-based insurer EXEL Ltd said on Friday that its board has authorized the repurchase of three million shares of its stock, expanding an existing stock buyback program.</p>
<p>EXEL said its current share repurchase program has approximately 1.5 million shares remaining to be repurchased.  </p>
<p>An EXEL spokesman said the company has about 87 million shares outstanding.</p>
